  - id: morning
    lines:
    - speaker: Player
      text: 
      dialogueLines:
      - ...Morning already?
      - What did I do wrong...
      - All through school, I thought that if I studied hard and kept practicing, I would graduate, do work I loved, earn my own money and make something I could be proud of.
      - ...I am tired.
      - Will pushing on really make anything better? Or am I wasting time on something that will never happen?
      - Quitting now would mean giving up on my dream... But if I keep going, I do not know how many more disappointments I can take.
      - What am I supposed to do now?
      - ...
      - ...
      - ...
      - ...Maybe it really is time to think about what I want to do with my life.
